# Railway Environment Variables Configuration
# Copy these to Railway Dashboard → Settings → Variables

# ============================================
# 🔧 SMTP EMAIL CONFIGURATION (CRITICAL FIX)
# ============================================

# ❌ OLD (NOT WORKING ON RAILWAY):
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your-user
# SMTP_PASS=your-pass

# ✅ NEW (WORKING ON RAILWAY - USE GMAIL):
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@example.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-specific-password  # Get from: myaccount.google.com/apppasswords

FROM_EMAIL=your-email@example.com
FROM_NAME=Substacker
ADMIN_EMAIL=your-email@example.com

# ============================================
# 📊 SUPABASE DATABASE
# ============================================
DATABASE_TYPE=supabase
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# ============================================
# 🔐 SECURITY SETTINGS
# ============================================
SECRET_KEY=your-random-secret-key-min-32-chars
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION=3600
SESSION_TIMEOUT=3600
CSRF_ENABLED=true

# ============================================
# 🌐 APPLICATION SETTINGS
# ============================================
BASE_URL=https://your-app.railway.app
GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# ============================================
# 📁 FILE UPLOAD LIMITS
# ============================================
MAX_FILE_SIZE=10485760
MAX_FILE_ROWS=10000

# ============================================
# 🚦 RATE LIMITING
# ============================================
RATE_LIMIT_UPLOAD=5/hour
RATE_LIMIT_SIGNUP=3/hour
RATE_LIMIT_LOGIN=5/minute

# ============================================
# 📝 HOW TO SET IN RAILWAY CLI
# ============================================
# railway variables set SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# railway variables set SMTP_PORT=587
# railway variables set SMTP_USER=your-email@example.com
# railway variables set SMTP_PASS=your-app-password
# railway up

# ============================================
# 🔍 TROUBLESHOOTING
# ============================================
# 1. Check logs: railway logs
# 2. Test locally: python test_email_config.py
# 3. Verify all variables: railway variables
# 4. Redeploy: railway up

# ============================================
# 📧 GMAIL APP PASSWORD SETUP
# ============================================
# 1. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 2. Enable 2-factor authentication (required)
# 3. Select "Mail" and "Other (Custom name)"
# 4. Name it: "Substacker Railway"
# 5. Copy the 16-character password
# 6. Use it as SMTP_PASS value (no spaces)

# ============================================
# ⚡ WHY GMAIL WORKS ON RAILWAY
# ============================================
# ✅ smtp.gmail.com is whitelisted on Railway
# ✅ No firewall blocking
# ✅ High deliverability (emails don't go to spam)
# ✅ Free: 500 emails/day with personal Gmail
# ✅ Free: 2000 emails/day with Google Workspace
# ✅ Reliable 99.9% uptime

# ============================================
# 🚀 ALTERNATIVE: SENDGRID (RECOMMENDED FOR PRODUCTION)
# ============================================
# Uncomment to use SendGrid instead of SMTP:
# EMAIL_PROVIDER=sendgrid
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=your-sendgrid-api-key
# FROM_EMAIL=verified-sender@yourdomain.com
# 
# Benefits:
# - Better deliverability
# - Email analytics
# - No SMTP port issues
# - Free tier: 100 emails/day
